<title>ESTONIA: HUVITUSFOND 1996 PROFIT 63.498 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>HUVITUSFOND 1996 PROFIT 63.498 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's Huvitusfond (Compensation Fund) said on Tuesday its audited profit was 63.498 million kroons in 1996 compared with 32 million kroons in 1995.  </p>
<p>Its assets were 1.075 billion kroons in 1996 compared to 657 million kroons in 1995, the fund added in a statement.</p>
<p>Assets fell by 14.1 million kroons after the audit, mostly because it excluded a swap deal of 12 million kroons from its balance sheet.</p>
<p>The fund allows people to invest their privatisation vouchers in the bonds which it issues.</p>
<p>The bonds are traded on the Tallinn stock exchange.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
